sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant SM as Secrets Manager
    participant KMS as AWS KMS
    
    App->>SM: GetSecretValue (SecretId)
    SM->>KMS: Decrypt (Encrypted Secret Payload)
    KMS-->>SM: Plaintext Secret Payload
    SM-->>App: Return Secret JSON
    Note over App: App caches secret in memory for 1 hour
